{"title":"Career Roadmap · Accountant","role":"Accountant","summary":"An Accountant records, classifies, reconciles and reports financial transactions while supporting taxation, compliance, budgeting and financial decision-making. For a BAF graduate, accounting is a strong entry route into finance, taxation, audit, FP&A and controllership.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"Banking, Accounting & Finance (BAF)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals, Excel, Tally/ERP, GST and financial statements"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Internship + practical bookkeeping, reconciliation and tax exposure"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Junior Accountant / Accounts Executive / Accountant"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Senior Accountant + reporting, taxation and audit"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Accounts Manager / Financial Reporting / FP&A specialisation"}],[{"text":"2040–2043"},{"text":"Finance Controller / Finance Manager / Tax Manager"}],[{"text":"2043–2046"},{"text":"Financial Controller / Head of Finance / CFO-track professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Journal, ledger, trial balance, Excel"},{"text":"Accounting workbook"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Practical accounting"},{"text":"Tally/ERP, GST basics, reconciliation"},{"text":"Mini bookkeeping project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Professional accounting"},{"text":"Financial statements, taxation, audit, MIS"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced finance + specialisation"},{"text":"Financial reporting, analysis, automation"},{"text":"Final project + internship"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — 